---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Leadership & Public Service">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Leadership & Public Service</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-10">Dignity’s leadership is defined by action and advocacy. His core contributions include:</p>
    
    <div class="space-y-8 mb-12">
      <div class="border-l-4 border-[#0F766E] pl-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Founder, Dignified Future Initiative (DFI)</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700">Established to promote education, leadership, and civil engagement in Nigeria.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-[#0F766E] pl-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Project Lead, EU-Funded Youth Advocacy Programme</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700">Spearheaded a two-day training program in Benin City (Feb 2026) for youth leaders on policy advocacy and democratic engagement.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-[#0F766E] pl-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Policy Contributor</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700">Authored policy essays on critical national issues, including the fuel subsidy removal and electoral reforms in West Africa.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-4 border-[#0F766E] pl-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">International Representative</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">Selected to participate in the ECOWAS Crisis Communication Framework Development Workshop (Abuja, 2024).</p>
        <!-- Added the ECOWAS workshop photo here -->
        <img src="/images/ecowas-workshop.jpg" alt="Dignity Amenaghawon at the ECOWAS Crisis Communication Framework Development Workshop" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-sm mt-4" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- IMAGE -->
    <img src="/images/eu-event-group.jpg" alt="Dignity leading the EU-funded youth advocacy training" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-sm" />
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-2 text-center">Leading the EU-funded Youth for Policy Advocacy & Development initiative in Benin City.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
